    approach: "Maven AI enters MENAT financial services as a governance-first agentic platform partner—not a generic AI integrator. In the GCC, we lead with sovereign-cloud-native agent deployment on AWS Riyadh, Azure UAE North, and Khazna/G42 Inception, paired with queryable audit-log infrastructure that satisfies SAMA AI principles and anticipated CBUAE governance standards before they become mandatory. Our proprietary Arabic financial-domain model assets—fine-tuned adapters over ALLAM and Falcon covering Shariah contract language, AAOIFI standards ingestion, and bilingual regulatory circular processing—are productised accelerators, not per-engagement rebuilds. In Türkiye, we deploy KVKK-compliant Turkish-language agents on domestic cloud infrastructure for mid-tier banks underserved by global vendors, anchored to BDDK escalation requirements and champion-challenger model risk governance aligned to local regulatory expectations.",
