    approach: "Maven AI leads MENAT automotive engagements from two anchors: Arabic-first agentic intelligence for GCC sovereign EV programmes, and EU AI Act dual-compliance architecture for Türkiye-based automotive suppliers. In the GCC, Maven's priority is building proprietary Gulf-dialect automotive corpus assets — through dealer copilot deployments with groups such as Abdul Latif Jameel and Al-Futtaim — that directly feed the NCA-compliant in-vehicle AI architecture Ceer and Lucid require before Chinese OEM market entry accelerates. In Türkiye, Maven leads with automotive-specific EU AI Act Annex III classification and KVKK-plus-GDPR dual-compliance advisory for Ford Otosan, Tofaş, and their tier-1 ecosystem — the only MENAT subregion where enforcement timelines are live today. Across both sub-regions, Maven embeds sovereign cloud compliance and edge-inference cost modelling as first-class architecture constraints, not afterthoughts.",
